          }
        },
        {
          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Can supervised and unsupervised learning be combined?&quot;,
          &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Question&quot;,
          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Often, yes. Cluster first, then train a supervised classifier to predict cluster membership for new records.&quot;,
            &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Answer&quot;
          }
        },
        {
          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;What is semi-supervised learning?&quot;,
          &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Question&quot;,
          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;A small labeled dataset paired with a much larger unlabeled one, mainly to save on labeling cost.&quot;,
            &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Answer&quot;
          }
        },
        {
          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;What is self-supervised learning?&quot;,
          &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Question&quot;,
          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;The model builds its own training targets from the data's structure. Most large language models rely on it.&quot;,
            &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Answer&quot;
          }
        },
