            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Machine learning is about building and training the model. MLOps is about keeping it running properly once it's live. Most people end up needing both eventually.&quot;,
            &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Answer&quot;
          }
        },
        {
          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Can a beginner learn machine learning without prior experience?&quot;,
