      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; color: #0369a1; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        2. Structured Data Schemas (JSON-LD)
      </h2>
      
          <div style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
            <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #1e293b;">Schema 1:</p>
            <pre style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 10px; font-family: Consolas, monospace; font-size: 9pt; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;">{
