          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;For most learners targeting the Indian or SMB job market, Power BI is the more practical first choice due to lower cost and stronger Microsoft ecosystem integration. Tableau is more relevant for large US enterprises and advanced visual analytics roles.&quot;,
