      &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Deepanshu completed his program in Data Science and Data Analytics and was placed at NIDADS (National Institute of Data Analytics &amp; Data Science). He now works as a Senior Data Analyst, covering Data Science, Data Analytics, Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Data Engineering, and Deep Learning.&quot;,
