          &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Question&quot;,
          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Start with Excel, then learn SQL and Power BI. These three tools alone can qualify you for many beginner-level analytics jobs and internships in India.&quot;,
